  "description": "The Microsoft DacFx SQL Projects Library provides an interface for programmatically creating and editing .sqlproj files and their contents.  It can be used to add, update, exclude, and delete items contained in a SQL Project, such as SQL object scripts, pre- and post-deployment scripts, publish profiles, SQLCMD variables, and database references, as well as to edit the property metadata of the project itself.",
